on of Stegosaurus at the Houston Museum of Natural Science.", "w": 4469, "h": 3815, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Stegosaurus dorsal plate - Museum of the Rockies - 2013-07-08.jpg", "src": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Stegosaurus_dorsal_plate_-_Museum_of_the_Rockies_-_2013-07-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stegosaurus_dorsal_plate_-_Museum_of_the_Rockies_-_2013-07-08.jpg", "artist": "Tim Evanson", "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0", "date": "2013-07-08", "caption": "Dorsal plate of Stegosaurus in a museum.", "w": 1590, "h": 2003, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Stegosaurus plates.jpg", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Stegosaurus_plates.jpg/960px-Stegosaurus_plates.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stegosaurus_plates.jpg", "artist": "Christophe Hendrickx", "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0", "date": "2011-04-12", "caption": "Plates of a mounted Stegosaurus skeleton.", "w": 2000, "h": 1500, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}], "sources": [{"kind": "original", "text": "Marsh, O. C. 1877. A new order of extinct Reptilia (''Stegosauria'') from the Jurassic of the Rocky Mountains. American Journal of Science 3(14): 513–514. doi:10.2475/ajs.s3-14.84.513"}, {"kind": "literature", "text": "Galton, P.M. 2010. Species of plated dinosaur ''Stegosaurus'' (Morrison Formation, Late Jurassic) of western USA: new type species designation needed. Swiss Journal of Geosciences 103(2): 187–198. doi:10.1007/s00015-010-0022-4"}, {"kind": "literature", "text": "International Commission on Zoological Nomenclature 2013. Opinion 2320 (Case 3536): ''Stegosaurus'